repository-code: "https://github.com/nstanisic1/ph908-reproducible-analysis"
abstract: >
  Reproducible R pipeline for the manuscript
  “I2a-PH908 branch structure supports a western-Balkan reservoir rather than
  a simple Slavic-period recipient model”. The repository contains deterministic
  preprocessing, six analytical pillars, figure and table rendering scripts,
  and publication-oriented outputs used to reproduce the manuscript results
  from curated branch-level input data.
license: "MIT"
